  "html": "<b>Rumunijos Ortodoksų Bažnyčia turi labai seną vienuolių-hesichastų tradiciją. Colți regione, karpatų kalnuose, galima rast 1050-1280 m. įrengtus atsiskyrėlių urvus. Šie vienuoliai vadinami urvų gyventojais - trogloditais (gr. <i>trōglodutēs</i>, nuo <i>trōglē </i>- skylė, ola).</b><br>\n<b><br></b>\n<br>\n<div>\n<a href=\"http://2.bp.blogspot.com/-FPHc9qN6TRs/VNZpaJm9ijI/AAAAAAAABtk/kidN0LKuck0/s1600/buzau-cave-church-romania-forests-buzau-585x306.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><b><img border=\"0\" height=\"167\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20190718085714im_/http://2.bp.blogspot.com/-FPHc9qN6TRs/VNZpaJm9ijI/AAAAAAAABtk/kidN0LKuck0/s1600/buzau-cave-church-romania-forests-buzau-585x306.jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></b></a></div>\n<br>\n<div>\n<a href=\"http://4.bp.blogspot.com/-882GiLmbUHU/VNZpZg_MvvI/AAAAAAAABtc/pPKq6sUym3k/s1600/alunis-schituri-rupestre-carpathian-buzau-mountains-570x378.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><b><img border=\"0\" height=\"212\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20190718085714im_/http://4.bp.blogspot.com/-882GiLmbUHU/VNZpZg_MvvI/AAAAAAAABtc/pPKq6sUym3k/s1600/alunis-schituri-rupestre-carpathian-buzau-mountains-570x378.jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></b></a></div>\n<br>\n<div>\n<a href=\"http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-bLOXKL8YAMI/VNZpZbF9w3I/AAAAAAAABts/Yl04zXk-OLY/s1600/39667003-570x760.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><b><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20190718085714im_/http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-bLOXKL8YAMI/VNZpZbF9w3I/AAAAAAAABts/Yl04zXk-OLY/s1600/39667003-570x760.jpg\" width=\"240\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></b></a></div>\n<br>\n<div>\n<a href=\"http://1.bp.blogspot.com/-Ax04KYcJpfs/VNZpZUwbmDI/AAAAAAAABtg/qncDZ9MCeX0/s1600/1524871_479419365503881_1824326129_n-570x379.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><b><img border=\"0\" height=\"212\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20190718085714im_